# depool-box — THE BOX PROGRAM for an Umbrel, with ONE Umbrel delta: the
# modules tree is BAKED instead of bind-mounted (an Umbrel box has no platform
# checkout, and umbrelOS forbids the host docker socket a self-updating mount
# would need).
#
# ⚠ IT IS THE CANONICAL IMAGE PLUS A TREE, NOT A SECOND PROGRAM (v0.3.0,
# 2026-09-20): the base is modules/mod-depool/box/Dockerfile's own published
# image (ghcr.io/hashoid/depool-lined), so the rig door, the door, the status
# page, the bead line and the claim/hello wire are the SAME bytes a bare-metal
# box runs. The tree lands at /modules — exactly the path the base image's CMD
# resolves (/modules/mod-depool/box/box.js) — and one revision of it: a baked
# program against a differently-revisioned rulebook is the skew that killed
# every round on 2026-09-11 (baked box called the newly-async mintBead,
# published a Promise, the relay answered "event is not an object").
#
# ⚠ WHY NOT MOUNT: every other service of this stack is a pinned GHCR image and
# umbrelOS gives an app no checkout to bind. This is the same shape the retired
# depool-sharechaind image had (it too ran box.js); v0.3.0 renamed it to what it
# actually is, because "sharechaind" stopped being a thing the box runs.
FROM ghcr.io/hashoid/depool-lined:v0.3.0
COPY modules /modules
